    "# \u2500\u2500 12. Ground-Truth Deployability Re-Check (real AWS) \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n",
    "# Every scenario already passed a deploy_pass=True gate to make it into\n",
    "# cfn_benchmark.csv / this final 250-row set in the first place (see\n",
    "# CLAUDE.md, cell 10 of cfn_benchmark_builder.ipynb). This cell RE-verifies\n",
    "# that same gate against a live AWS account, now that the benchmark is\n",
    "# frozen -- real AWS has things LocalStack can't fully emulate (IAM\n",
    "# propagation delays, real service quotas, actual AMI/AZ availability), and\n",
